      "comment": "Nabu Malikata: The Jinn and the goddess",
      "content": "The first Jinn were born from water lilies in gardens fed by the goddess's wounds. After her death King Deshret told them she merely slept and promised to help find her in return for their service. Liloupar was a Jinni of hers; in 6.6 she gave her life to remove the goddess's last remains from Collei.",
