      "comment": "Nabu Malikata: Sabzeruz Festival origin",
      "content": "In the Chinese and Japanese text the festival is named after Nabu Malikata, the \"Goddess of Flowers\"; she began it as a celebration of her friend Rukkhadevata's birthday, and on one such birthday she foresaw the cataclysm. After Rukkhadevata's death it came to mark Lesser Lord Kusanali's birthday.",
