      ],
      "comment": "Nabu Malikata: Her remains in Collei",
      "content": "Dottore used her unrecovered remains in experiments on Eleazar and others. Collei was the only subject to merge with them but could not control them, and the remains' lingering malice harmed those near her until Cyno sealed them. They gave her visions of Irminsul's fate. Liloupar took out the last fragment in Your Past Is Like a Garden.",
